# The pristine launcher starts and reads its own files: every EPIC-00 setup,
# GEMDRIVE and PPDRIVER, gets this far (EPIC-00 STORY-05). What happens after
# FILES/ is EPIC-01's question; the last screenshot shows it.
expect start-tos Pexec\(0, "C:\\LEMMINGS\\START\.TOS"
expect info-text Cconws\(
expect pch Fopen\("LEMMINGS\.PCH"
expect d15r Fopen\("D15R_[FH]5\.FIC"
expect ls2dd Fopen\("LS2DD\.FIC"
expect files-dir Dsetpath\("FILES"\)
sleep 10
shot after-files
